      "color": "orange",
      "text": "Two Clocks. The slow and fast factors as two dials; the finding told as 'the market can’t read the clocks'.\n\nLayout: Two-column spreads around dials and a shock-decay chart; rounded panels; Unbounded headlines.\nThe memorable thing: Two dials, each a two-year clock with its hand on the factor's half-life (1.4 years, 51 days).\nType: Unbounded 500–700 for headlines, numbers and dial labels; Karla 400–700 for text, tables and charts.\nLight: bg #EDEFF7, surf #FFFFFF, ink #141B34, muted #55607D, acc #D1343F, line #C5CCE2\nDark: bg #0B1024, surf #121A36, ink #E8ECFA, muted #8F99BE, acc #FF6B6B, line #28335C\nMagnet rail on the left edge. Live prices on these boards are NSE closing prices from 25 Sep 2026; every chart is drawn from real data or the project's pricer."
    }
